<head>
<title>AreaSGN: Creation of spectral signatures and statistics from training areas</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/></head>
<body>
<a id="MENU" name="MENU"></a>
<!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al titol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<p><ul>
<h4>Direct access to online <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/" target="_blank">help</a>: <a href="https://www.miramon.cat/help/eng/msa/AreaSGN.htm" target="_blank"><font size="+2">AreaSGN</font></a></h4>
<h4>Access the application from the menu: <i>"Tools | Image classification | Compute spectral signatures and spectral statistics"</i></h4>
</ul></p>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

